<p>Clones the target creature for up to <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">6, 8, 9, 10, 12</acronym> turns.  The duration of the effect will be divided by half the target's rank, and the target will have have <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">51%, 54%, 57%, 60%, 62%</acronym> of its normal life and deal <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">48%, 45%, 42%, 39%, 37%</acronym> less damage.</p><p>If you clone a hostile creature the clone will target the creature it was cloned from.</p><p>The life and damage penalties will be lessened by your Spellpower.</p>